#: .\templates\core\about.html:15
msgid "About HTaP ALGERIA"
msgstr "À propos de HTaP ALGÉRIE"

#: .\templates\core\about.html:18
msgid ""
"KHADIDJA National Association for Pulmonary Arterial Hypertension (HTaP "
"ALGERIA) is a registered national charitable organization."
msgstr ""
"L’Association nationale KHADIDJA pour l’hypertension artérielle pulmonaire "
"(HTaP ALGÉRIE) est une organisation caritative nationale enregistrée."

#: .\templates\core\about.html:30 .\templates\core\home.html:143
msgid "Our Commitment"
msgstr "Notre engagement"

#: .\templates\core\about.html:33
msgid "Putting an end to invisibility and isolation"
msgstr "Mettre fin à l’invisibilité et à l’isolement"

#: .\templates\core\about.html:37
msgid ""
"Our mission is to empower the Algerian community fighting against pulmonary "
"hypertension through awareness, advocacy, education, research, and support "
"provided to individuals affected by PAH. We aim to break the invisibility "
"and isolation often experienced by those affected by this severe and rare "
"disease."
msgstr ""
"Notre mission est de renforcer la communauté algérienne confrontée à "
"l’hypertension pulmonaire grâce à la sensibilisation, à la défense des "
"droits, à l’éducation, à la recherche et au soutien des personnes touchées "
"par l’HTAP. Nous voulons briser l’invisibilité et l’isolement souvent vécus "
"par les personnes confrontées à cette maladie rare et grave."

#: .\templates\core\about.html:40
msgid ""
"HTaP ALGERIA offers patients information about the disease, psychological "
"support, and a valuable platform to exchange experiences among those "
"affected. Our primary goal remains to break the isolation of every patient."
msgstr ""
"HTaP ALGÉRIE offre aux patients des informations sur la maladie, un soutien "
"psychologique et une précieuse plateforme d’échange d’expériences entre "
"personnes concernées. Notre objectif principal reste de rompre l’isolement "
"de chaque patient."

#: .\templates\core\about.html:51
msgid "Continuous Support"
msgstr "Soutien continu"

#: .\templates\core\about.html:53
msgid ""
"We support patients and their loved ones daily through a network of mutual "
"aid, medical guidance, and specialized emotional support."
msgstr ""
"Nous soutenons quotidiennement les patients et leurs proches grâce à un "
"réseau d’entraide, d’orientation médicale et de soutien émotionnel "
"spécialisé."

#: .\templates\core\about.html:77 .\templates\core\home.html:713
msgid "Mrs. Khadidja Ali Kacem, founder and first president of HTaP ALGERIA"
msgstr ""
"Mme Khadidja Ali Kacem, fondatrice et première présidente de HTaP ALGÉRIE"

#: .\templates\core\about.html:82
msgid "Founder & First President"
msgstr "Fondatrice et première présidente"

#: .\templates\core\about.html:86
msgid "Mrs. Khadidja Ali Kacem"
msgstr "Mme Khadidja Ali Kacem"

#: .\templates\core\about.html:98 .\templates\core\home.html:730
msgid "Our Story"
msgstr "Notre histoire"

#: .\templates\core\about.html:102
msgid "An association born from a deeply human commitment"
msgstr "Une association née d’un engagement profondément humain"

#: .\templates\core\about.html:108
msgid ""
"\n"
"                        The KHADIDJA National Association for Pulmonary "
"Arterial Hypertension (HTaP ALGERIA) was established in 2018 by its founder "
"and first president, Mrs. Khadidja Ali Kacem.\n"
"                        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                        L’Association nationale KHADIDJA pour l’hypertension "
"artérielle pulmonaire (HTaP ALGÉRIE) a été créée en 2018 par sa fondatrice "
"et première présidente, Mme Khadidja Ali Kacem.\n"
"                        "

#: .\templates\core\about.html:114
msgid ""
"\n"
"                        Through her dedication, Mrs. Khadidja Ali Kacem "
"helped give a voice to those affected by pulmonary arterial hypertension, "
"making awareness, education, and patient support a top priority.\n"
"                        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                        Grâce à son dévouement, Mme Khadidja Ali Kacem a "
"contribué à donner une voix aux personnes touchées par l’hypertension "
"artérielle pulmonaire, faisant de la sensibilisation, de l’éducation et du "
"soutien aux patients une priorité.\n"
"                        "

#: .\templates\core\about.html:120
msgid ""
"\n"
"                        Today, the association bears her name in tribute to "
"its founder and continues the mission she initiated in service of patients "
"and their families.\n"
"                        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                        Aujourd’hui, l’association porte son nom en hommage "
"à sa fondatrice et poursuit la mission qu’elle a initiée au service des "
"patients et de leurs familles.\n"
"                        "

#: .\templates\core\about.html:137
msgid "In memory of Mrs. Khadidja Ali Kacem"
msgstr "À la mémoire de Mme Khadidja Ali Kacem"

#: .\templates\core\about.html:141
msgid ""
"\n"
"                                May God have mercy on her soul, grant her "
"forgiveness, and make Paradise her final abode. Her name, dedication, and "
"work will remain deeply rooted in the memory of our association and all the "
"individuals she supported.\n"
"                                "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                                Que Dieu ait pitié de son âme, lui accorde "
"Son pardon et fasse du Paradis sa demeure finale. Son nom, son dévouement et "
"son travail resteront profondément ancrés dans la mémoire de notre "
"association et de toutes les personnes qu’elle a soutenues.\n"
"                                "

#: .\templates\core\about.html:148
msgid "Founder of HTaP ALGERIA — 2018"
msgstr "Fondatrice de HTaP ALGÉRIE — 2018"

