#: .\templates\core\home.html:295
msgid "Understanding the Disease"
msgstr "Comprendre la maladie"

#: .\templates\core\home.html:299
msgid "What is Pulmonary Arterial Hypertension?"
msgstr "Qu’est-ce que l’hypertension artérielle pulmonaire ?"

#: .\templates\core\home.html:303
msgid ""
"Pulmonary Arterial Hypertension (PAH) is a rare condition characterized by "
"an abnormal increase in blood pressure within the pulmonary arteries. This "
"elevated pressure places an increased workload on the heart, particularly "
"affecting the right ventricle."
msgstr ""
"L’hypertension artérielle pulmonaire (HTAP) est une affection rare "
"caractérisée par une augmentation anormale de la pression artérielle dans "
"les artères pulmonaires. Cette pression élevée accroît le travail du cœur, "
"en particulier celui du ventricule droit."

#: .\templates\core\home.html:307
msgid ""
"PAH requires a specialized medical evaluation to confirm the diagnosis, "
"identify underlying causes, and establish a personalized treatment plan."
msgstr ""
"L’HTAP nécessite une évaluation médicale spécialisée pour confirmer le "
"diagnostic, identifier les causes sous-jacentes et établir un plan de "
"traitement personnalisé."

#: .\templates\core\home.html:318
msgid "Shortness of Breath"
msgstr "Essoufflement"

#: .\templates\core\home.html:321
msgid ""
"Breathlessness, particularly during physical exertion, can be a key "
"indicator of the condition."
msgstr ""
"L’essoufflement, notamment lors des efforts physiques, peut être un signe "
"important de la maladie."

#: .\templates\core\home.html:332
msgid "Persistent Fatigue"
msgstr "Fatigue persistante"

#: .\templates\core\home.html:335
msgid "Unusual and persistent tiredness may also be experienced."
msgstr "Une fatigue inhabituelle et persistante peut également être ressentie."

#: .\templates\core\home.html:346
msgid "Specialized Diagnosis"
msgstr "Diagnostic spécialisé"

#: .\templates\core\home.html:349
msgid ""
"Diagnosis relies on targeted medical tests and often requires evaluation at "
"a specialized center."
msgstr ""
"Le diagnostic repose sur des examens médicaux ciblés et nécessite souvent "
"une évaluation dans un centre spécialisé."

#: .\templates\core\home.html:358
msgid "Learn more about PAH"
msgstr "En savoir plus sur l’HTAP"

#: .\templates\core\home.html:387
msgid "A disease affecting the pulmonary arteries"
msgstr "Une maladie qui touche les artères pulmonaires"

#: .\templates\core\home.html:422
msgid "Pulmonary Pressure"
msgstr "Pression pulmonaire"

#: .\templates\core\home.html:425
msgid "Abnormally high pressure in the pulmonary arteries."
msgstr "Une pression anormalement élevée dans les artères pulmonaires."

#: .\templates\core\home.html:436
msgid "Right Ventricle"
msgstr "Ventricule droit"

#: .\templates\core\home.html:439
msgid "The right side of the heart experiences an increased strain."
msgstr "Le côté droit du cœur est soumis à une charge accrue."

#: .\templates\core\home.html:460
msgid "PAH in Algeria"
msgstr "L’HTAP en Algérie"

#: .\templates\core\home.html:475
msgid "PAH patients treated since 2007"
msgstr "Patients atteints d’HTAP pris en charge depuis 2007"

#: .\templates\core\home.html:478
msgid "Estimate based on available Algerian data"
msgstr "Estimation fondée sur les données algériennes disponibles"

#: .\templates\core\home.html:491
msgid "patients enrolled in a prospective Algerian study"
msgstr "patients inclus dans une étude algérienne prospective"

#: .\templates\core\home.html:494
msgid "PAH and chronic thromboembolic pulmonary hypertension"
msgstr "HTAP et hypertension pulmonaire thromboembolique chronique"

#: .\templates\core\home.html:507
msgid "of patients in this study presented Group 1 PAH"
msgstr "des patients de cette étude présentaient une HTAP du groupe 1"

#: .\templates\core\home.html:510
msgid "Algerian study of 70 patients"
msgstr "Étude algérienne portant sur 70 patients"

#: .\templates\core\home.html:523
msgid "of patients in the PAH group were female"
msgstr "des patients du groupe HTAP étaient des femmes"

#: .\templates\core\home.html:526
msgid "Data from a prospective study conducted in Algeria"
msgstr "Données issues d’une étude prospective menée en Algérie"

#: .\templates\core\home.html:536
msgid ""
"National epidemiological data on PAH remains fragmented and dispersed. "
"Consequently, these figures do not constitute a definitive estimate of the "
